      "speaker": null,
      "text": "In this section you cover:\n• Present infinitives, active and middle: παύειν, παύεσθαι\n• Irregular present infinitives: εἶναι, ἰέναι, εἰδέναι\n• Verbs taking infinitives (e.g. βούλομαι, δεῖ, δοκέω)\n• Comparative and superlative adjectives, regular and irregular\n• Past of εἶμι: ᾖα ‘I went’",
      "lang": "mixed",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": "bullet",
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
