      "margin_number": 150,
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "In English the present infinitive is the form of the verb created by the addition of\n‘to’: ‘to go’, ‘to listen’, ‘to do’, etc. This is how the infinitive is formed in Greek:",
      "lang": "en",
      "para_no": 1,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
